# Projects and Context

Projects organize related chats and context.

Examples:

- Biology
- Personal Finance
- Coreside Development
- College Planning
- Fitness
- Creative Writing

A project may include:

- Chats
- Project instructions
- Project summaries
- Relevant tools
- Relevant media
- Relevant automations
- Project panels
- Project wallpaper assignments

The agent should have access to relevant context across the active project.

This does not mean sending every project message to the model on every turn.

Use:

- Project instructions
- Current chat context
- Chat summaries
- Project summaries
- Local full-text retrieval
- Explicit references
- Relevant tool context
- Bounded retrieved snippets

Project isolation is mandatory.

A chat in Project A must not automatically receive data from Project B.

Enforce isolation in trusted database and Rust queries, not only in the frontend.

